              "message": "The onboarding regression test relies on unanchored substring checks for both the first-run and later-bootstrap guidance. Unrelated prose, negated statements, or separate examples containing these phrases would satisfy the assertions without proving that `init` is prescribed for newly exported scaffolds and `bootstrap` only for already initialized repositories. Parse the relevant instructions or assert the intended command/context relationship directly.",
