        {
          "type": "final",
          "verdict": "findings_remain",
          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "This test expects `git init` before the identity probes in both the missing-identity trace and the success sequence, but the currently exported `init` task runs `git var GIT_AUTHOR_IDENT`/`GIT_COMMITTER_IDENT` before `git init`. Consequently the assertion here fails immediately, and the success-path sequence is also unsatisfiable. Reconcile the test and the `other`-scope implementation so the current change set uses one ordering.",
